<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners buy 79.04 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</title>
<headline>Foreigners buy 79.04 mln rand S.Africa bonds Mon.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners bought a net 79.04 million rand worth of South African bonds on Monday after selling a net 4.66 million rand on Friday, the Bond Exchange said.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
